//            --json number,title,state,author,isDraft,reviewDecision,labels,updatedAt,url
// Shape notes (Phase 8 re-verifies each): `state` arrives UPPERCASE ("OPEN"); `author` is a bare
// `{ "login": ... }` object or null; `isDraft` is a plain boolean; `reviewDecision` is UPPERCASE
// ("APPROVED" / "CHANGES_REQUESTED" / "REVIEW_REQUIRED") and an EMPTY STRING when no review has
// happened yet — the parser passes decisions through verbatim and maps "" to null. PR lists carry
// no `comments` field. Rows: draft, APPROVED, CHANGES_REQUESTED, null author.
